# Flow Music - Tech Stack

## Core Framework
* **Streamlit:** Python-based web framework used to build and deploy the interactive user interface, manage layout grids, tabs, and session state.

## Data Management
* **Pandas:** Handles data loading, manipulation, and filtering of the master song and content catalog.
* **OpenPyxl:** Provides Excel file reading support (`flowmusic.xlsx`) for the dataset loader.

## Search & Matching Engine
* **RapidFuzz:** Powers the real-time, typo-tolerant fuzzy search engine (`fuzz.WRatio`) across song titles, genres, prompts, and interactive spaces.

## Configuration & Environment
* **Python-dotenv:** Loads local environment variables (boilerplate setup).